00:00:51.429 --> 00:01:17.143
Here are the key terms. Write these down.

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:42.857
Leak Repair Exemption: Small appliances are exempt from mandatory leak repair
rules but recovery is still required before disposal.

00:01:42.857 --> 00:02:08.571
Here's why this matters on the job: Even though leak repair is not required you
must still recover refrigerant before disposing of any appliance.

00:02:08.571 --> 00:02:34.286
Watch out for these: Exemption is from leak REPAIR not from recovery. And —
Scrap dealers must also recover refrigerant

00:02:34.286 --> 00:03:00.000
